ions  around the world  apparently including the folks at disney  and marvel loki is said to follow the  titular character throughout time  and passing himself off as or actually  being the subject of one of the most  bizarre unsolved mysteries in history  is very low-key check out one of our  newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about the mcu  are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss  a single one  [Music]  you

